{"version":1,"content":"<p>廣東佛山有餐廳推出「水蟑螂（即龍虱、水曱甴）蛋撻」引起關注，店主日前接受媒體訪問稱，這款蛋撻於10月初開始售賣，一份3個，售價28元人民幣。</p><p>他還稱，這款蛋撻鹹甜口感，有外省消費者專程來吃，口感類似「在蛋撻上放了一片薯片」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:18:54.646236+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T18:57:33.932966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:17:34.193466+00:00","content_hash":"45aac9b6ed19063bc643c9a6f785efff03d8dc068cba20a36957bdef027d4127","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}